WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,620
One hundred and eight top-grade fine armor and god-shaped talismans

2
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:10,800
Plus thirty-six of the finest Kunlun jade stones.

3
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:14,430
How much does it cost?

4
00:00:14,430 --> 00:00:26,860
Dead old man

5
00:00:26,860 --> 00:00:28,860
I won’t study it because it’s too expensive.

6
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:30,860
You're going to pass the blame to me, right?

7
00:00:30,860 --> 00:00:31,860
Vigo calm down

8
00:00:31,860 --> 00:00:33,860
That's your father's ancestral manuscript

9
00:00:33,860 --> 00:00:36,850
One hundred and eight photos of the best blessings

10
00:00:36,850 --> 00:00:38,850
Thirty-six Kunlun jade stones

11
00:00:38,850 --> 00:00:44,700
Even if you sell your son, you won’t be able to raise enough start-up capital.

12
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:46,930
Do you have any other ways to break the formation?

13
00:00:46,930 --> 00:00:50,220
Who said you have to spend money to break the formation?
